The user will ask something like: "I'm going through a legal process and need to organize my thoughts. The case involves immigration status review. My lawyer is Michael Torres at Dowd Legal; we have proceedings at housing court. The di..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


